  "idea": "Zapier transfer tool for bulk migrating legacy spreadsheet data",
  "text": "Upgrade your business systems without losing a single piece of historical client data. Companies get locked into clunky legacy spreadsheets because migrating active accounts into modern tools feels risky. Rushed CSV imports often drop notes, break custom phone formatting, and corrupt client relationship records. Use Zapier Transfer to visually validate fields and migrate historical spreadsheet data cleanly into Airtable bases. You modernize business operations with zero data loss.",
